        "id": "4a83d069"
      },
      "source": [
        "Paytm, a leading digital payments company, faces the critical challenge of fraudulent transactions. These fraudulent activities lead to significant financial losses, erode customer trust, and tarnish the company's reputation. The objective of this project is to develop a robust machine learning solution capable of detecting fraudulent digital transactions before they are completed, thereby minimizing financial losses and enhancing transaction security.\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook outlines an end-to-end ML pipeline, from data creation to model deployment, specifically designed to address Paytm's fraud detection needs."
      ]
    },
